byob-artifact-host
=================

byob-artifact-host renders HTML app artifacts for the byob desktop app. byob runs it as a
separate process; it is not linked into byob.

Its own source code (host/artifact-host/src and crates/artifact-wire in the byob
repository) is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0, like the rest of byob.

The binary includes Servo (https://servo.org, https://github.com/servo/servo) and
SpiderMonkey via mozjs (https://github.com/servo/mozjs), which are licensed under the
Mozilla Public License, version 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). The source code of
those components is available from the links above; the exact versions used are listed in
host/artifact-host/Cargo.lock (servo 0.8.0, mozjs_sys 153.6.0-1). We have not modified them.

Other dependencies are under permissive licences (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, Zlib and
similar), or MPL-2.0 for some Servo-project crates; see Cargo.lock and each crate's
licence on crates.io.
